Where a metric is ambiguous, compute it both ways and say so.

# Focus

Where are we losing conversions, and for which segments (device / geo / destination)?

Plan the queries. You MUST cover all cuts: overall, trend, device, geo, funnel, segment, and at least one anomaly query. Every query MUST use GROUP BY or aggregate functions. Never use SELECT *. Return only the JSON object.
